{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hiring Now: Baristas!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become Barista</strong>\u00a0is a coffee shop management sim combined with life simulation. You'll start your barista journey in the city with a cozy apartment and a charming corner caf\u00e9.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566230/extras/8e8d1d67e87fe617aabe03c7e88e8b19.apng?t=1754949520\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566230/extras/8e8d1d67e87fe617aabe03c7e88e8b19.poster.avif?t=1754949520\" class=\"bb_img\" width=320 height=320 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brew classic coffee drinks</strong>, from rich espresso to creamy lattes, satisfying even the most demanding customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash your creativity</strong>\u00a0by crafting signature specialty drinks, turning your caf\u00e9 into the city\u2019s most popular hotspot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Listen to customers\u2019 stories</strong>, fulfill their unique coffee cravings, and maybe even uncover unexpected surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your ingredients wisely</strong>\u2014keep your coffee beans and supplies fresh to serve the finest flavors every day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock a delivery system</strong>, master the art of coffee-making, and spread the aroma of your brews across the city to boost profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand your business</strong>\u00a0by opening a bakery, where you can bake delicious pastries that pair perfectly with coffee, attracting even more customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design your personal space</strong>\u2014decorate your apartment with furniture and d\u00e9cor, creating a cozy retreat for your quiet moments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;We're low on milk, don't forget to order some today.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566230/extras/11b0f16813874de0575cb8bd63642444.apng?t=1754949520\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566230/extras/11b0f16813874de0575cb8bd63642444.poster.avif?t=1754949520\" class=\"bb_img\" width=320 height=320 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;No decent bakery in this part of town, huh?&quot; a customer muttered, the craving for a good croissant evident. And in that simple lament, you caught a scent \u2013 the scent of opportunity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566230/extras/baed934cf8b48fa470ce2080b8f2e388.apng?t=1754949520\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566230/extras/baed934cf8b48fa470ce2080b8f2e388.poster.avif?t=1754949520\" class=\"bb_img\" width=320 height=320 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566230?t=1754949520","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566230/4942c606a9bf87641b9b877906e5481333d5a2a8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754949520","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566230/bf4cfaa584f10d78f22eb1e0efcb7b173127978a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754949520","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3